    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ground bison, milk, bread crumbs, green chile peppers, bacon bits, egg, liquid smoke, onion powder, dry mustard, garlic powder, and ground sage in a bowl. Mix by hand.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
